  {
   "text": "Google's Flash-Lite made up eight of twelve.",
   "start": 11.08,
   "end": 14.23
  },
  {
   "text": "OpenAI's GPT-OSS made up five of twelve.",
   "start": 14.23,
   "end": 18.46
  },
  {
   "text": "Real topics were answered normally.",
   "start": 19.0,
   "end": 20.64
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is one invented answer.",
   "start": 21.36,
   "end": 22.98
  },
  {
   "text": "A confident answer is not a true one.",
